# pstack model configuration. One line per role. Delete a line to fall back to the skill default.
# `inherit-parent` or `auto` as a value: the role runs on the parent chat model (omit Task `model`). Alias entries in a panel list still count toward its fan-out.
# Never use fast-mode slugs.
# User decision 2026-11-05 (same for all project repos): 4.7 high for code, investigation, swarm, review, judgment and synthesis; 4.7 low for exploration, tooling, prose and explanation; panels pair 4.7 high with 4.6 high; 4.7 xhigh only for the hardest tasks.
# Grok 4.6 high stays as a second voice on panels: AkitaOnRails LLM Benchmark v4 (code-review vigilance) scored it 98.5 vs 83.5 for 4.7.
# budget: medium (high)
feature, refactoring: grok-4.7-high
bug-fix: grok-4.7-high
perf-issue: grok-4.7-high
hillclimb: grok-4.7-high
judgment: grok-4.7-high
prose: grok-4.7-low
hardest tasks: grok-4.7-xhigh
how explorer: grok-4.7-low
how explainer: grok-4.7-low
why investigators: grok-4.7-high
why synthesizer: grok-4.7-high
reflect tooling: grok-4.7-low
reflect judgment, divergent, synthesizer: grok-4.7-high
arena runners: grok-4.7-high, cursor-grok-4.6-high
arena cross-judge pool: grok-4.7-high, cursor-grok-4.6-high
